    en: ["An ancient Numidian-Roman city that served as a major center of early Christian theology and literature in Africa.", "Located within the People's Democratic Republic of Algeria.", "Plays a role in the local identity of the region.", "Known for its scenic or cultural significance.", "Documented in local and regional studies."]
