    en: ["A traditional oasis fortress town in the Saoura valley, located deep in the Sahara and with a rich caravan history.", "Located within the People's Democratic Republic of Algeria.", "Plays a role in the local identity of the region.", "Known for its scenic or cultural significance.", "Documented in local and regional studies."]
