    en: ["A historic 13th-century royal palace complex that served as the residence for the Ziyyanid rulers of Tlemcen.", "Located within the People's Democratic Republic of Algeria.", "Plays a role in the local identity of the region.", "Known for its scenic or cultural significance.", "Documented in local and regional studies."]
