    en: ["One of the best-preserved examples of Almoravid architecture in the Maghreb, holding historical religious significance for the region.", "Located within the People's Democratic Republic of Algeria.", "Plays a role in the local identity of the region.", "Known for its scenic or cultural significance.", "Documented in local and regional studies."]
