    en: ["An old Andalusian town in Algeria, known for its traditional architecture and as a refuge for Moorish refugees after the Reconquista.", "Located within the People's Democratic Republic of Algeria.", "Plays a role in the local identity of the region.", "Known for its scenic or cultural significance.", "Documented in local and regional studies."]
