      en: ["Built in 1007 under Sultan Hammad ibn Buluggin", "Wall height: up to 8 meters (26 feet)", "Site area: approximately 2.5 hectares (6.2 acres)", "Number of preserved cisterns: 4", "Destroyed in 1152 by the Almohads under Abd al-Mu'min", "Distance to the Mediterranean coast: 80 kilometers (50 miles)"],
